reviews.text:
This looked like a new place, more of a grocery store than restaurant so u might be better off taking it to go;
I had the Chicken Gabyere and it was good; they didn’t provide enough spices for the entire sandwich
Service as not good; staff doesn’t speak English; I asked them to make fries extra crispy and they ended up giving me another fries order and made me pay for it!! 😡
